              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">8244aa14-8295-4233-adec-0982a019f231</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10"></item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">ENGINEERING WORKFLOW / 2D
1 Run BASELINE FEM. 2 Run OPTIMIZATION. 3 After completion, Run FINAL VERIFICATION.
Use REVIEW to choose Stage, Case and Field. Only one stage preview is visible. Read the viewport legend.
Threshold verification is binary voxel FEM on the same grid, without smoothing or remeshing.
A removed support/load node or disconnected shape is rejected. Preserve interfaces or change the design.
Material properties are reference data; inspect Material Info and report limitations.</item>
                  </items>
