                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">REVIEW
Stage selects the visible result, not the calculation to run.
Case selects a saved response after completion.
Field 0: FEM stress or design density. Field 1: displacement.
Field 2: stress; during optimization this is RELAXED design stress.
Set the same positive legend maximum to compare a field across stages.
Deformation scale changes display only. Report contains all cases.</item>
